{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/604640-condition-idea-black-listed","id":604640,"title":"Condition Idea (Black Listed)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-27T06:43:40-07:00","id":604640,"title":"Condition Idea (Black Listed)","content":"Hello everyone I wanted to get some idea's for this condition I was creating.<br /> <br /> The Condition is<br /> <br /> Black Listed<br /> <br /> Effects: You have been outed in the demonic community no Agency will give you help what so ever. No do you have the protection of any agency you worked with.<br /> <br /> Resolution: (I don't know yet hoping you could help met with that.)<br /> <br /> Beats:<br /> <br /> I don't know what the resolution should be or if the players should get beats for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 07-27-2015, 09:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-27T08:03:13-07:00","id":604706,"title":"","content":"First concern: does it need to be a Condition? The purpose of Conditions is to highlight situations as a carrot and stick to propel the story. If the purpose is just to support a situation where a demon is outcast as a traitor, you may not really need any mechanics for it. In fact, Demon's spy genre can probably benefit from avoiding making it an absolute. A known breach of trust doesn't necessarily make you a useless factor, and status as an outcast actually makes you a good potential underground operative \u2014 so long as the connection between you and your employer isn't discovered.<br /> <br /> The main reason why you might use it as a Condition, I think, is if a player wants to take it on as a Persistent Condition in a similar spirit to being, say, Addicted, filling the same role as 1e's Flaws. In that case, you'd want a beat trigger that helps highlight the difficulties of living with that status and how it can contribute to the game's story.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Disavowed (Persistent)</b></span><br /> You have a bad reputation in the demonic community. You may have brought an agency to ruin for your own gain, been involved in repeated mission failures, or even turned your brethren over to the God-Machine. You may not even be at fault, but the Unchained consider you a disavowed asset, and business with fellow demons must be done under the table and at a disadvantage. Lose 3 dice on Social rolls relating to Unchained goodwill.<br /> <b>Beat:</b> Put yourself at the mercy of a demon who has no major reason to help you.<br /> <b>Resolution:</b> Clear your name or achieve a triumphant act of redemption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 07-27-2015, 11:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T09:54:36-07:00","id":606730,"title":"","content":"Thats good <br /> <br /> Hmmm I also got an idea for a embed <br /> <br /> It would be another version of in my pocket but for guns. <br /> <br /> <u><b>How many shots </b></u><br 